       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC WS-FILE
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
       01 EMPLOYEE-LINE PIC X(100).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FILE PIC X(100).
       01 WS-ID PIC X(5).
       01 WS-NAME PIC X(40).
       01 WS-SALARY PIC 9(8)V99.
       01 WS-BONUS PIC 9(8)V99.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(8)V99.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-ARGUMENT PIC X(100).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-ARGUMENT.
           MOVE LS-ARGUMENT TO WS-FILE
           OPEN INPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE
           DISPLAY "PAYROLL REPORT"
           PERFORM UNTIL 1 = 2
               READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
                   AT END EXIT PERFORM
                   NOT AT END
                       UNSTRING EMPLOYEE-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
                           INTO WS-ID WS-NAME WS-SALARY
                       COMPUTE WS-BONUS = WS-SALARY * 0.10
                       COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-SALARY + WS-BONUS
                       DISPLAY WS-ID " " WS-NAME " TOTAL: " WS-TOTAL
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE
           GOBACK.
